%% Thesis — telemetry and actuation timing of one control-loop iteration (measured p50 / p99)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant G as gNB
  participant X as xApp (ingest + policy)
  participant S as Sidecar
  participant U as UPF
  participant M as SMF → producer → A1-EI
  U->>M: N4 usage report (period 1 s)
  M->>X: URR + profile (1.5 s / 2.8 s after measurement)
  G->>X: E2SM-KPM indication (1 ms / 49 ms)
  X->>S: POST /classify (window + latest URR)
  S-->>X: label, level, layer (20 ms / 48 ms; timeout 200 ms → rules fallback)
  alt isolate
    X->>G: E2SM-RC slice handover (ack 0.4 ms)
  end
  alt block
    X->>U: PUT block (26 ms / 64 ms)
  end
  Note over G,U: KPM measured → RC ack: 39 ms / 100 ms (max 168 ms), loop period = KPM period 1 s
